---
import HyperlinkIcon from "@/components/icons/Hyperlink.svg";
---

<div class="mt-20">
	<h4 class="uppercase font-bold text-2xl pb-4 pl-1 text-unlu-green-dark">
		Secciones principales
	</h4>
	<div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4">
		<a href="#">
			<article
				class="bg-white h-full flex flex-col justify-between p-4 rounded-lg hover:scale-105 active:scale-95 transition-transform duration-300"
			>
				<div class="flex justify-between gap-2">
					<h5 class="font-semibold text-lg">Inicio</h5>
					<HyperlinkIcon />
				</div>
				<p>Página de la secretaría de planeamiento.</p>
			</article>
		</a>
		<a href="#">
			<article
				class="bg-white h-full flex flex-col justify-between p-4 rounded-lg hover:scale-105 active:scale-95 transition-transform duration-300"
			>
				<div class="flex justify-between gap-2">
					<h5 class="font-semibold text-lg">La Secretaría</h5>
					<HyperlinkIcon />
				</div>
				<p>Misión, valores y actividades de planeamiento estratégico.</p>
			</article>
		</a>
		<a href="#">
			<article
				class="bg-white h-full flex flex-col justify-between p-4 rounded-lg hover:scale-105 active:scale-95 transition-transform duration-300"
			>
				<div class="flex justify-between gap-2">
					<h5 class="font-semibold text-lg">
						Plan de Desarrollo Institucional
					</h5>
					<HyperlinkIcon />
				</div>
				<p>PDI 2026-2036: dimensiones y horizonte estratégico.</p>
			</article>
		</a>
	</div>
</div>
